Krita Nova 83 - preset previews of color-tip brushes show the tip's colors

The live previews (patch 02) drew every brush in the theme's text color.
Brushes whose tip is a color image (an image or animated brush with real
color, not a gray tip) now show:
- the small tip icon in the tip's own colors;
- the stroke in the tip's colors: a tip used as "Color image" paints its
  own colors, a tip used as a mask or lightness map is painted with the
  tip's average color instead of the theme color.
Gray tips, gradient-map tips and the smudge / deform / filter engines are
drawn as before.

